            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justices also asked whether implied consent could be sufficient."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "859ff7dd0b50704aa1114a733541cada894e582dc3f2b7f64916d63ff1bc7b14",
